GLEIF legal identity reference data

The pinned country, Accepted Legal Jurisdictions v1.5 and ISO 20275 Entity Legal
Forms v1.6 references are provided by the Global Legal Entity Identifier Foundation
under CC0: https://www.gleif.org/en/about/open-data . Generated data preserves
source identifiers and native names. Source versions, hashes, bounded crosswalks
and reproduction are documented in docs/legal-identity-catalog.md and
scripts/legal-identity/generate-reference.py. No GLEIF endorsement is implied.
